              "marks": [],
              "value": "For instance, a law firm could create a client portal where clients can access legal documents, track their case progress, and communicate with their lawyer. A financial planner could use a client portal to share account information, financial analysis, and reports. In both cases, the client portal provides a centralized location for clients to access important information and communicate with their service provider.",
