              "marks": [],
              "value": "A custom domain is a personalized web address for a website or online platform. It replaces the generic domain provided by the hosting service with a unique and memorable domain name. Using a custom domain can help establish a brand identity, improve search engine optimization, and increase the credibility of the website. ",
