              "marks": [],
              "value": "Gap analysis is a process used to identify discrepancies or gaps between current performance and desired outcomes. It is commonly used in business to identify areas where improvements can be made to increase profitability or productivity. By comparing current performance against a desired goal, gap analysis helps organizations identify where they need to focus their resources to achieve their objectives.",
