              "value": "Landing page optimization is the process of improving the performance of a landing page to increase conversions. This is typically achieved by testing different elements of the page, such as headlines, images, and calls to action, to see which combinations result in the highest conversion rates. By optimizing a landing page, businesses can increase the number of visitors who take a desired action, such as making a purchase or filling out a form.",
