              "value": "For example, if a company has a customer base of young adults who enjoy outdoor activities, they can create a lookalike audience by finding individuals who share similar interests, age range, and other relevant characteristics. They can then target their marketing efforts towards this audience, increasing their chances of getting new customers who are more likely to convert.",
